<title>SWITZERLAND: Banque Cantonale Vaudoise sets 150 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Banque Cantonale Vaudoise sets 150 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following offering was announced by the borrower and lead manager to yield 4.22 pct at issue.</p>
<p>BORROWER - BANQUE CANTONALE VAUDOISE</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - SAME</p>
<p>AMT  = 150 MLN CHF</p>
<p> COUPON - 4.25 PCT	MATURITY - 12.DEC.06</p>
<p> ISS PRICE - 100.25     PAY DATE - 12.DEC.96</p>
<p>LISTING - SWITZERLAND  TYPE - STR  VAL NR - 547  915	ISIN  - CH0005479156</p>
<p>NOTE - ISSUE LAUNCHED AS PERMANENT GLOBAL CERTIFICATE.</p>
<p>-- ZURICH EDITORIAL, 41 1 631 7340</p>
